  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About: Reads the Unmatched AePS xlsx, runs a rule-based AI root-cause engine per exception and routes it:&#xd;&#xa; - Auto-Reversal track: terminal hardware / timeout failure (RC 91 / 96 / dispense fault), customer debited, amount &lt; INR 5,000,&#xd;&#xa;   within RBI T+1 TAT (txn date decoded from RRN)  -&gt; POST AUTO_APPROVED reversal instruction to NPCI_URL (CBS reversal queue).&#xd;&#xa; - HITL track: biometric tamper / spoof alert, or exposure (amount or GL variance) &gt; INR 10,000 -&gt; SHA-256 sealed evidence dossier&#xd;&#xa;   POSTed as PENDING_APPROVAL to NPCI_QUEUE_URL.&#xd;&#xa; - Everything else (incl. TAT breaches) is PARKED_OPS_REVIEW and recorded in AePS_Dispatch_Plan_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx.&#xd;&#xa;Thresholds are config params (AUTO_REVERSAL_LIMIT, HITL_THRESHOLD, RBI_TAT_DAYS).&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Runtime params: UnMatched_File_Path, NPCI_URL, NPCI_QUEUE_URL. Success: &#x22;AePS AI Root-Cause Completed - Dual-Track Enqueued&#x22;.&#xd;&#xa;Errors: inputs validated up front; connection failures go down the REST error hop and are normalised into the audit,&#xd;&#xa;non-2xx responses are API_REJECTED; any failed dispatch ends the run in Failure.</note>
      <xloc>64</xloc>
      <yloc>680</yloc>
      <width>900</width>
      <heigth>300</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>11</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>192</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>192</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>192</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>100</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>100</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>100</bordercolorblue>
      <drawshadow>Y</drawshadow>
      <shadow_size>5</shadow_size>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
</transformation>
